  <p>
    CA training is two years under the new scheme (ICAI FAQ). ICAI recommends these monthly minimum stipends for those two years, pending a change to the regulation. A draft was published in the Gazette on 25 June 2026, and comments closed on 5 August 2026.
  </p>

