  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      <strong>The most scalable ownership path in commerce is a small-business accounts, tax and analytics service, or selling an analytics skill directly.</strong> It scales because you set the price, package repeat monthly work into a fixed offer, keep a client list you own, and can later hire a junior or a freelancer to do the routine parts.
    </p>
    <p>
      A CA, CS or CMA practice is the same idea with a credential on top. A salary is a tool to save and learn, while owning a client list or a practice is where larger income builds. Much of this work can be done remotely for clients in other cities, which matters if you want to live outside a metro. None of this is guaranteed. It needs proof, follow-up and patience, and you can start it while holding a job. Once you invoice, check current GST and Udyam rules on the official portals.
